      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُقْصَانٌ</span></b> : see 1: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَقْصٌ</span>, in two places.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  It also signifies The <i>quantity that is gone,</i> or
<i>lost, of a thing that is decreased</i> or <i>diminished</i> or
<i>lessened.</i> (Lth, A, K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُقْصَانُهُ كَذَا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَكَذَا</span> <i>The quantity that is gone,</i> or <i>lost, of it is
such and such.</i> (TK.)

